# Document-level statistics — test-main (post-review reanalysis)

Unit: document (n = 8). Per-document mean over runs; 95% percentile bootstrap over documents (10,000 resamples, seed 7). Exact tests on 8 documents cannot go below p = 0.0078. Holm family: the five pre-registered contrasts of C1/RNV on far recall (per model); other contrasts exploratory, unadjusted. b/c: probe-level discordant counts restricted to the probes the metric counts (descriptive). No equivalence test is claimed.

